{"title":"Lizper Feet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 46) · Monster drop: Warchief Ruk Gorehand, Kragg The Unmoved, Gutrot The Carver, Old Mother Ashka, Mountain Ogre +11 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 46 <span class=\"muted\">(2109 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/lizper-scale\">Lizper Scale</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"emberfang-heart\" title=\"The Emberfang&#39;S Heart - dropped it in 2 of 3 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/5e68e9d0b6af82b39346.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Emberfang&#39;S Heart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dryback\" title=\"Dryback - dropped it in 1 of 3 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/db15a9bfa88238ad85fe.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dryback</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 12 of 181 looted corpses (1/15)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 8 of 180 looted corpses (1/23)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span